  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A beam of monochromatic light of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"600\"></span> nm is incident on a single slit and a diffraction pattern is formed on a screen.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The angle between the first minima is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0 \\times 10^{-3}\"></span> rad. What is the width of the slit?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.002\"></span> cm</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.004\"></span> cm</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.02\"></span> cm</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.04\"></span> cm</li>\n</ol>"
